<Base title="Home" description="Straussi Festival 2027 at the Straußäcker student residences in Stuttgart. Info on programme, getting there and tickets." isHome>
  {/* English version of pages/index.astro. Hero, countdown and Instagram section come from components/HomePage.astro. */}
  <HomePage>
    <p>
      <strong>Straussi Festival 2027</strong> is the festival of the Straußäcker student residences in Stuttgart, organised by a team of residents of Straussi 1, 2 &amp; 3.
    </p>
    <p>Two days, one venue, loads of good vibes: on 11 and 12 June 2027 the grounds of the Straußäcker residences turn into a festival site. Organised by students, for everyone aged 18 and over, with music, food trucks and drinks.</p>
    <h2>Programme and line-up</h2>
    <p>The line-up has not been fixed yet. We will announce it here as soon as it is ready.</p>
    <h2>Tickets</h2>
    <p><TicketLink>Tickets</TicketLink> are available from our <TicketLink>ticket partner</TicketLink>. The button above takes you straight to the <TicketLink>ticket shop</TicketLink>.</p>
    <p>Presale is on! There are <TicketLink>day tickets</TicketLink> for Friday or Saturday and <TicketLink>weekend tickets</TicketLink> for both days.</p>
